          "text": "Témoignages: CHALLAIN-LA-POTHERIE (49) 10.06.1979",
          "text_sha256": "cdccdb78c37afe46dcf46ffa0743e7c0d0f6803699971d4882e0cda5bf40d5f8"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
